{"seq":3,"slug":"color-and-formatting","title":"颜色与格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/color-and-formatting","wordCount":807,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"颜色与格式化\">颜色与格式化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>颜色与格式化</strong>是 CLI 传递语义的手段：绿色表示成功、黄色表示警告、红色表示错误。其底层是<strong>ANSI 转义码</strong>——一段嵌入文本的字节序列，终端据此改变样式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>底层机制</td>\n<td>手写 ANSI 转义码</td>\n<td>可读性差、易出错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封装库</td>\n<td>owo-colors / chalk</td>\n<td>跨平台一致，推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义约定</td>\n<td>颜色承载固定含义</td>\n<td>需统一，避免随意用色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境适配</td>\n<td>尊重 <code>NO_COLOR</code> 与 TTY</td>\n<td>管道/日志中应禁用颜色</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键原则：<strong>颜色是增强而非唯一信息载体</strong>——当颜色被禁用时，语义仍应可读。本文从 ANSI 转义码讲到颜色库、降级策略与表格输出。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ansi-转义码\">ANSI 转义码</h2><p><strong>ANSI 转义码</strong>（ANSI Escape Codes）是终端颜色和文本样式的底层机制。所有终端颜色库本质上都在生成这些转义序列。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>转义码</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重置</td>\n<td><code>\\x1b[0m</code></td>\n<td>清除所有样式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粗体</td>\n<td><code>\\x1b[1m</code></td>\n<td>加粗文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红色前景</td>\n<td><code>\\x1b[31m</code></td>\n<td>红色文字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绿色前景</td>\n<td><code>\\x1b[32m</code></td>\n<td>绿色文字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黄色前景</td>\n<td><code>\\x1b[33m</code></td>\n<td>黄色文字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝色前景</td>\n<td><code>\\x1b[34m</code></td>\n<td>蓝色文字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红色背景</td>\n<td><code>\\x1b[41m</code></td>\n<td>红色背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>256 色</td>\n<td><code>\\x1b[38;5;{n}m</code></td>\n<td>256 色前景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RGB 色</td>\n<td><code>\\x1b[38;2;{r};{g};{b}m</code></td>\n<td>真彩色前景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;\\x1b[32m✓ 操作成功\\x1b[0m&quot;);&#10;    println!(&quot;\\x1b[33m⚠ 发现警告\\x1b[0m&quot;);&#10;    println!(&quot;\\x1b[31m✗ 发生错误\\x1b[0m&quot;);&#10;    println!(&quot;\\x1b[1m\\x1b[34m信息: 正在处理...\\x1b[0m&quot;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"\\x1b[32m✓ 操作成功\\x1b[0m\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"\\x1b[33m⚠ 发现警告\\x1b[0m\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"\\x1b[31m✗ 发生错误\\x1b[0m\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"\\x1b[1m\\x1b[34m信息: 正在处理...\\x1b[0m\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 直接使用 ANSI 转义码容易出错且可读性差，生产代码应使用颜色库来封装。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rust-owo-colors-与-colored\">Rust：owo-colors 与 colored</h2><p><strong>owo-colors</strong> 是零分配的高性能颜色库，<strong>colored</strong> 则以 API 简洁著称。两者都是 Rust CLI 开发中的常用选择。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use owo_colors::OwoColorize;&#10;&#10;fn print_status(success: bool, message: &amp;str) {&#10;    if success {&#10;        println!(&quot;{} {}&quot;, &quot;✓&quot;.green().bold(), message);&#10;    } else {&#10;        println!(&quot;{} {}&quot;, &quot;✗&quot;.red().bold(), message);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn print_build_output() {&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, &quot;=== 构建报告 ===&quot;.cyan().bold());&#10;    println!();&#10;&#10;    print_status(true, &quot;编译通过&quot;);&#10;    print_status(true, &quot;测试通过 (42/42)&quot;);&#10;    print_status(false, &quot;lint 发现 3 个警告&quot;);&#10;&#10;    println!();&#10;    println!(&quot;{}: 总耗时 {}&quot;,&#10;        &quot;摘要&quot;.blue().bold(),&#10;        &quot;12.3s&quot;.yellow()&#10;    );&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    print_build_output();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use owo_colors::OwoColorize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn print_status(success: bool, message: &#x26;str) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if success {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"{} {}\", \"✓\".green().bold(), message);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"{} {}\", \"✗\".red().bold(), message);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn print_build_output() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", \"=== 构建报告 ===\".cyan().bold());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print_status(true, \"编译通过\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print_status(true, \"测试通过 (42/42)\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print_status(false, \"lint 发现 3 个警告\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}: 总耗时 {}\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"摘要\".blue().bold(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"12.3s\".yellow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print_build_output();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"颜色约定\">颜色约定</h2><p>CLI 工具中的颜色使用应遵循社区约定，让用户凭直觉理解信息的性质。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>颜色</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n<th>图标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绿色</td>\n<td>成功/通过</td>\n<td>操作完成、测试通过</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红色</td>\n<td>错误/失败</td>\n<td>操作失败、编译错误</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黄色</td>\n<td>警告/注意</td>\n<td>非致命问题、deprecation</td>\n<td>⚠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝色/青色</td>\n<td>信息/标题</td>\n<td>进度信息、章节标题</td>\n<td>ℹ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灰色</td>\n<td>次要/辅助</td>\n<td>时间戳、路径、ID</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粗体</td>\n<td>强调</td>\n<td>关键数值、重要名称</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use owo_colors::OwoColorize;&#10;&#10;enum LogLevel {&#10;    Info,&#10;    Warn,&#10;    Error,&#10;    Success,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn log(level: LogLevel, msg: &amp;str) {&#10;    match level {&#10;        LogLevel::Info =&gt; eprintln!(&quot;{} {}&quot;, &quot;ℹ&quot;.blue().bold(), msg),&#10;        LogLevel::Warn =&gt; eprintln!(&quot;{} {}&quot;, &quot;⚠&quot;.yellow().bold(), msg),&#10;        LogLevel::Error =&gt; eprintln!(&quot;{} {}&quot;, &quot;✗&quot;.red().bold(), msg),&#10;        LogLevel::Success =&gt; eprintln!(&quot;{} {}&quot;, &quot;✓&quot;.green().bold(), msg),&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    log(LogLevel::Info, &quot;正在检查项目配置...&quot;);&#10;    log(LogLevel::Success, &quot;配置文件有效&quot;);&#10;    log(LogLevel::Warn, &quot;发现未使用的依赖: serde_yaml&quot;);&#10;    log(LogLevel::Error, &quot;端口 3000 已被占用&quot;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use owo_colors::OwoColorize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum LogLevel {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Info,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Warn,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Error,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Success,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn log(level: LogLevel, msg: &#x26;str) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match level {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        LogLevel::Info => eprintln!(\"{} {}\", \"ℹ\".blue().bold(), msg),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        LogLevel::Warn => eprintln!(\"{} {}\", \"⚠\".yellow().bold(), msg),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        LogLevel::Error => eprintln!(\"{} {}\", \"✗\".red().bold(), msg),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        LogLevel::Success => eprintln!(\"{} {}\", \"✓\".green().bold(), msg),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log(LogLevel::Info, \"正在检查项目配置...\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log(LogLevel::Success, \"配置文件有效\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log(LogLevel::Warn, \"发现未使用的依赖: serde_yaml\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log(LogLevel::Error, \"端口 3000 已被占用\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"颜色降级与-no_color\">颜色降级与 NO_COLOR</h2><p>在非 TTY 环境或用户明确要求时，CLI 工具必须能够禁用颜色输出。<strong>NO_COLOR</strong> 是社区广泛认可的标准。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::io::IsTerminal;&#10;&#10;struct ColorConfig {&#10;    enabled: bool,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl ColorConfig {&#10;    fn detect() -&gt; Self {&#10;        let enabled = std::io::stdout().is_terminal()&#10;            &amp;&amp; std::env::var(&quot;NO_COLOR&quot;).is_err()&#10;            &amp;&amp; std::env::var(&quot;TERM&quot;).map(|t| t != &quot;dumb&quot;).unwrap_or(true);&#10;        Self { enabled }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn green(&amp;self, text: &amp;str) -&gt; String {&#10;        if self.enabled {&#10;            format!(&quot;\\x1b[32m{}\\x1b[0m&quot;, text)&#10;        } else {&#10;            text.to_string()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn red(&amp;self, text: &amp;str) -&gt; String {&#10;        if self.enabled {&#10;            format!(&quot;\\x1b[31m{}\\x1b[0m&quot;, text)&#10;        } else {&#10;            text.to_string()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let color = ColorConfig::detect();&#10;    println!(&quot;{} 测试通过&quot;, color.green(&quot;✓&quot;));&#10;    println!(&quot;{} 测试失败&quot;, color.red(&quot;✗&quot;));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::io::IsTerminal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct ColorConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    enabled: bool,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl ColorConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn detect() -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let enabled = std::io::stdout().is_terminal()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x26;&#x26; std::env::var(\"NO_COLOR\").is_err()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x26;&#x26; std::env::var(\"TERM\").map(|t| t != \"dumb\").unwrap_or(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Self { enabled }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn green(&#x26;self, text: &#x26;str) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if self.enabled {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            format!(\"\\x1b[32m{}\\x1b[0m\", text)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            text.to_string()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn red(&#x26;self, text: &#x26;str) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if self.enabled {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            format!(\"\\x1b[31m{}\\x1b[0m\", text)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            text.to_string()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let color = ColorConfig::detect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{} 测试通过\", color.green(\"✓\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{} 测试失败\", color.red(\"✗\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环境变量</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>NO_COLOR</code></td>\n<td>设置后禁用颜色</td>\n<td>no-color.org 标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FORCE_COLOR</code></td>\n<td>强制启用颜色</td>\n<td>部分工具支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TERM=dumb</code></td>\n<td>终端不支持颜色</td>\n<td>POSIX 标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CLICOLOR=0</code></td>\n<td>禁用颜色</td>\n<td>部分工具支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"表格输出\">表格输出</h2><p><strong>表格</strong>（Table）是展示结构化数据的最佳方式之一。Rust 的 <code>tabled</code> 和 <code>comfy-table</code> 提供了丰富的表格渲染能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tabled::{Table, Tabled, settings::Style};&#10;&#10;#[derive(Tabled)]&#10;struct Package {&#10;    #[tabled(rename = &quot;包名&quot;)]&#10;    name: String,&#10;    #[tabled(rename = &quot;版本&quot;)]&#10;    version: String,&#10;    #[tabled(rename = &quot;大小&quot;)]&#10;    size: String,&#10;    #[tabled(rename = &quot;状态&quot;)]&#10;    status: String,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let packages = vec![&#10;        Package {&#10;            name: &quot;clap&quot;.into(),&#10;            version: &quot;4.5.0&quot;.into(),&#10;            size: &quot;320 KB&quot;.into(),&#10;            status: &quot;✓ 最新&quot;.into(),&#10;        },&#10;        Package {&#10;            name: &quot;serde&quot;.into(),&#10;            version: &quot;1.0.195&quot;.into(),&#10;            size: &quot;210 KB&quot;.into(),&#10;            status: &quot;✓ 最新&quot;.into(),&#10;        },&#10;        Package {&#10;            name: &quot;tokio&quot;.into(),&#10;            version: &quot;1.35.0&quot;.into(),&#10;            size: &quot;890 KB&quot;.into(),&#10;            status: &quot;⚠ 有更新&quot;.into(),&#10;        },&#10;    ];&#10;&#10;    let table = Table::new(&amp;packages)&#10;        .with(Style::rounded())&#10;        .to_string();&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, table);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tabled::{Table, Tabled, settings::Style};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Tabled)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Package {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[tabled(rename = \"包名\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[tabled(rename = \"版本\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    version: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[tabled(rename = \"大小\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    size: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[tabled(rename = \"状态\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    status: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let packages = vec![</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Package {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            name: \"clap\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            version: \"4.5.0\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            size: \"320 KB\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            status: \"✓ 最新\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Package {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            name: \"serde\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            version: \"1.0.195\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            size: \"210 KB\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            status: \"✓ 最新\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Package {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            name: \"tokio\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            version: \"1.35.0\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            size: \"890 KB\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            status: \"⚠ 有更新\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let table = Table::new(&#x26;packages)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with(Style::rounded())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .to_string();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", table);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[结构化数据] --&gt; B{输出格式}&#10;    B --&gt;|TTY| C[彩色表格]&#10;    B --&gt;|管道| D[TSV/CSV]&#10;    B --&gt;|--json| E[JSON]\">graph LR\n    A[结构化数据] --&gt; B{输出格式}\n    B --&gt;|TTY| C[彩色表格]\n    B --&gt;|管道| D[TSV/CSV]\n    B --&gt;|--json| E[JSON]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 表格输出在窄终端中可能换行变形。可以通过检测终端宽度来调整列宽或截断长字段。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"node-js-chalk-与-cli-table3\">Node.js：chalk 与 cli-table3</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import chalk from &#39;chalk&#39;;&#10;&#10;function printBuildReport(): void {&#10;  console.log(chalk.cyan.bold(&#39;=== 构建报告 ===&#39;));&#10;  console.log();&#10;  console.log(chalk.green(&#39;✓&#39;) + &#39; 编译通过&#39;);&#10;  console.log(chalk.green(&#39;✓&#39;) + &#39; 测试通过 (42/42)&#39;);&#10;  console.log(chalk.yellow(&#39;⚠&#39;) + &#39; lint 发现 3 个警告&#39;);&#10;  console.log();&#10;  console.log(chalk.blue.bold(&#39;摘要&#39;) + &#39;: 总耗时 &#39; + chalk.yellow(&#39;12.3s&#39;));&#10;}&#10;&#10;printBuildReport();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chalk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'chalk'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> printBuildReport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark