>));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">printBuildReport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((颜色与格式化))&#10;    ANSI 转义码&#10;      16色/256色/真彩色&#10;      前景/背景/样式&#10;    颜色约定&#10;      绿色=成功&#10;      红色=错误&#10;      黄色=警告&#10;      蓝色=信息&#10;    颜色库&#10;      owo-colors (Rust)&#10;      colored (Rust)&#10;      chalk (Node.js)&#10;    降级策略&#10;      TTY 检测&#10;      NO_COLOR 标准&#10;      TERM=dumb&#10;    表格输出&#10;      tabled (Rust)&#10;      cli-table3 (Node.js)\">mindmap\n  root((颜色与格式化))\n    ANSI 转义码\n      16色/256色/真彩色\n      前景/背景/样式\n    颜色约定\n      绿色=成功\n      红色=错误\n      黄色=警告\n      蓝色=信息\n    颜色库\n      owo-colors (Rust)\n      colored (Rust)\n      chalk (Node.js)\n    降级策略\n      TTY 检测\n      NO_COLOR 标准\n      TERM=dumb\n    表格输出\n      tabled (Rust)\n      cli-table3 (Node.js)</pre><ul>\n<li>ANSI 转义码是终端颜色的底层机制，生产代码应通过颜色库封装</li>\n<li>颜色使用应遵循社区约定：绿色成功、红色错误、黄色警告、蓝色信息</li>\n<li>必须支持 NO_COLOR 环境变量和非 TTY 环境的颜色降级</li>\n<li>表格输出适合展示结构化数据，同时应支持 JSON/CSV 等机器可读格式</li>\n<li>owo-colors 零分配高性能，chalk API 简洁直观，各自适合对应的语言生态</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"颜色与格式化","id":"颜色与格式化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ANSI 转义码","id":"ansi-转义码"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust：owo-colors 与 colored","id":"rust-owo-colors-与-colored"},{"level":2,"text":"颜色约定","id":"颜色约定"},{"level":2,"text":"颜色降级与 NO_COLOR","id":"颜色降级与-no_color"},{"level":2,"text":"表格输出","id":"表格输出"},{"level":2,"text":"Node.js：chalk 与 cli-table3","id":"node-js-chalk-与-cli-table3"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"进度与动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/progress-and-spinners"},"next":{"title":"帮助与文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/help-and-documentation"}}